
1 - How to find duplicate records?
SELECT 
    user_id,
    COUNT(*) AS duplicate_count
FROM customer_data
GROUP BY user_id
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;


2 - How to delete duplicate records?
DELETE FROM customer_data
WHERE user_id IN (
    SELECT user_id
    FROM customer_data
    GROUP BY user_id
    HAVING COUNT(*) > 1
);


